# IMPLEMENTATION_STEPS: cu-001

1. Create src/main/scala/newspipe/domain/valueObjects/GeoArea.scala with exactly the content in the scala fence below.
```scala
package newspipe.domain.valueObjects

opaque type GeoArea = String

object GeoArea:
  def apply(s: String): GeoArea = s
  extension (g: GeoArea) def value: String = g
```
Prove: `cat src/main/scala/newspipe/domain/valueObjects/GeoArea.scala` prints the opaque type plus companion.
2. Create src/main/scala/newspipe/domain/valueObjects/Urgency.scala with exactly the content in the scala fence below.
